414 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Dexterity Score increases by 2\054 your Strength score increases by 1\056\nAge\056 Goblins are expected to have reached maturity no later than the age of 5\073 however\054 the maximum lifespan of Goblins is nearly incalculable\056 Most die young due to their incessant curiosity and tendency to unwittingly run straight towards their own demise\056\nAlignment\056 A Goblin\047s alignment varies wildly from one to another\056 While most Goblins could be categorized as Chaotic Neutral\054 the existence of Goblins in any area of the alignment spectrum is not uncommon\056\nSize\056 Weighing between 50 and 75 lbs\054 Goblins range from 3 to 4 feet tall\056 Your size is Small\056\nSpeed\056 Your base walking speed is 25 feet\056\nDarkvision\056 You have superior vision in dark and dim conditions\056 You can see in dim light within 60 feet of you as if it were bright light\054 and in darkness as if it were dim light\056 You can\047t discern color in darkness\054 only shades of gray\056\nLanguages\056 You can speak\054 read\054 and write Common and Goblin\056\nCowardly\056 Goblins have learned the perfect means to escape a tough situation\056 You may disengage as a bonus action on your turn\056\nGoblin Weapon Proficiency\056 You gain proficiency with the blowgun and net\056\nGoblin Claws\056 Your thick Goblin claws give you a climbing speed equal to your walking speed\056 In addition\054 your claws are natural weapons\054 which you can use to make unarmed strikes\056 If you hit with them\054 you deal slashing damage equal to 1d4 \053 your Strength modifier\054 instead of the bludgeoning damage normal for an unarmed strike\056\nQuick\055Tongued\056 Whether begging for your life or bartering for the best price for your wares\054 you\047ve learned how to persuade others to see your point of view\056 You gain proficiency in your choice of Persuasion or Deception\056\n)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 415 0 R
     /Pg 408 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

